 rs. Chamber members most often do business with other chamber members\, so
  bring a stack of your business cards and get ready to talk shop in the la
 id-back atmosphere that Business After Hours provides. Of course\, there w
 ill be plenty of socializing and great food\, too.\nNot only is Business A
 fter Hours a great way to make new contacts and build your referral list\,
  but you will also likely find a service provider there that you have been
  looking for\, as well. South Baldwin Chamber events are mutually benefici
 al and prove to be an excellent way to build relationships with others in 
 our business community.\nNo registration required!\n*Members Only Event*\n
